<title>NETHERLANDS: STORK WINS 65 MLN GUILDER ORDER.</title>
<headline>STORK WINS 65 MLN GUILDER ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>NAARDEN, Netherlands 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial systems and services group Stork NV said on Friday it won an order of 65 million guilders from the Dutch government agency dealing with road works.  </p>
<p>The order for Stork Nolte Infratchniek, a unit of Stork NV, involves installation of road signals and lighting along some highways in the provence of Gelderland, in the east of the Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
